WEBVTT

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:07.380
Look up.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.340
There I am.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.620
I am the sky.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:15.620
I am a warm, protective, blanket.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.900
Wrapped around everyone on earth.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:24.660
I can bring clouds, rain, and wind.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.420
I can be an ice storm.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:32.280
Without me, you'd fry.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:35.570
Every day, I am the breath you take in.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:38.730
Yet you are making me sick.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:40.329
I am congested.

00:00:40.329 --> 00:00:42.140
Off balance.

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.809
Polluted.

00:00:43.809 --> 00:00:46.449
You see, I am more delicate than you think.

00:00:46.449 --> 00:00:50.190
It took millions of years to get it just right

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.350
my perfect mix of gases,

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:54.859
temperature and weather that you enjoy.

00:00:54.859 --> 00:00:58.719
But now your cars, your factories and dust

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.730
they have pushed me past the limit.

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:04.990
And you wonder why my typhoons and tornadoes

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:07.900
are more intense, more frequent?

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:12.170
I’ve become unpredictable.

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:13.310
Less rain here.

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.270
A lot more rain there.

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:17.710
Hotter summers.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:19.450
Colder winters.

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:23.140
I can’t even control myself anymore.

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:24.560
Enough about me.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:29.740
I will show my changing self to you in your
days ahead.

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:32.070
But in the end, I’ll be fine.

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:33.770
Give me a few thousand years,

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:37.960
I have weathered trauma before.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:43.360
I am not worried for myself.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:44.680
Look up.